 zero/one/many project-shell refresh-control coverage while preserving pending refresh metadata behavior.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added focused shell-bootstrap coverage proving project source summaries expose the target-count state the UI now relies on.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[\"tests/service/client/source-management-ui.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":617,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":4},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/client/source-management-ui.test.ts --environment jsdom\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"not-run\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":0,\"findingsFixed\":[\"Project-shell stale/not_hydrated rows no longer falsely offer refresh when zero or multiple current process targets exist.\",\"Project-shell refresh remains available when ownership of the working copy is unambiguous via exactly one current process target.\",\"Pending refresh stayed modeled as refresh metadata rather than a fifth hydration state.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Proceed to verification with attention on the new project-shell target-count behavior and confirm the later cross-process project-level target-selection story can replace this gating when designed.\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/03-hydration-and-freshness-management/009-continue.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-05-04T21:26:37.462Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-05-04T21:29:30.356Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
